name: Erratic Spades Spike — many Spades
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 20 Spades, a suit spike for Flush lines,
  Wrathful Joker, Arrowhead, and Smeared Joker pivots. RAG aliases: erratic spades,
  all Spades, spade flush seed, black suit pile, screenshot suit spike.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticSuit: Spades
    min: 20
should:
  - joker: Arrowhead
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: WrathfulJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    label: "Combines Spades and Clubs into black-suit support"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheTribe
    label: "Flush payoff from Spade density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
